cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analytical code, please cite the archived software release."
title: "Reproducible R code for working-age mortality from ischemic heart disease in Brazil, 2015–2024"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Sardinha"
    given-names: "Daniele Melo"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-20"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DanieleSardinha/ihd-brazil-working-age-2015-2024"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible R code for the nationwide study of ischemic heart disease
  mortality among working-age adults in Brazil, including age-standardized
  mortality rates, temporal trends, sex and regional analyses, years of
  potential life lost, data-quality assessment, hospital utilization, and
  mortality-related productivity losses.
